    "开启后先进行 ICMP ping，只有回应的设备才会扫描端口。关闭后直接探测所有目标的指定 TCP 端口。不回应 ping 不代表设备离线。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, each address is pinged (ICMP) first and only devices that reply have their ports scanned. When off, the selected TCP ports are probed on every address. Not replying to ping doesn't mean a device is offline."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后先进行 ICMP ping，只有回应的设备才会扫描端口。关闭后直接探测所有目标的指定 TCP 端口。不回应 ping 不代表设备离线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
